### Create an alert
POST http://localhost:5000/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "latitude": 8.9806,
  "longitude": 38.7578
}

### Get all alerts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/alerts

### Resolve alert (change 1 to your alert's id)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/alerts/1/resolve